add name/description
create snapshot

2) copy snapshot to another region
ec2->snapshots
select the snapshot
actions->copy snapshot
choose destination region
click copy snapshot

3) switch to des region
change region
ec2->snapshots
check that snapshot is available

4) create volume from snapshot
